{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">無綫節目《今個夏天食平D》中，肥媽親自教大家炮製一道「陳醋涼拌八彩素絲」。這道菜式加入了陳醋與麻油調味，口感豐富且極具層次，絕對是一道十分適合夏天享用的開胃冷盤佳餚！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1bd564c6-d701-4e1c-afa4-17cdb6b5bfc3.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026WnK2mpJGLb1784108895.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1bd564c6-d701-4e1c-afa4-17cdb6b5bfc3.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>陳醋涼拌八彩素絲食材</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">主料： 豆乾、豆卜、蘿蔔、青瓜、三色椒</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">調味料： 陳醋、醬油、麻油、糖、芝麻</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>簡易製作步驟</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f3ed7f31-4647-4973-a54c-62b186be01a0.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026wNGwIgDAyq1784108890.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f3ed7f31-4647-4973-a54c-62b186be01a0.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>肥媽入廚小貼士</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-20T02:13:56.806758+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}